  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:352px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Guardian_executioner.jpg\" title=\"Shadow Pinnacle Guardian Executioner\"><img alt=\"Shadow Pinnacle Guardian Executioner\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"259\" src=\"/images/Guardian_executioner.jpg\" width=\"350\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Guardian_executioner.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Shadow Pinnacle Guardian Executioner</div></div></div>\n<p>Two Guardian Executioners are found in the <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow's_Embrace\" title=\"Shadow's Embrace\">Shadow's Pinnacle</a>, each contained in a Shadow Pinnacle Guardian Sarcophagus.  Both of them must be killed to open the gate to the <a href=\"/wiki/Queen_of_Shadows\" title=\"Queen of Shadows\">Queen of Shadows</a>.\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
